<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Verify your email</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111; }
    .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: #111; color: #fff; padding: 24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .otp { display: inline-block; margin: 16px 0; padding: 12px 24px; background: #f0faf9; border: 2px solid #54BAB9; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #54BAB9; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 32px 24px; font-size: 13px; color: #666; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>JHAMAT</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <%= recipient_name %>,</p>
      <p>Thanks for signing up. Use the verification code below to confirm your email address:</p>
      <div class="otp"><%= otp %></div>
      <p>This code is valid for <strong>2 minutes</strong>. Do not share it with anyone.</p>
      <p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;margin-top:24px;"><em>This is an automated message — please do not reply.</em></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> JHAMAT. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
